@startuml
title Package: the promoter's rights at an occasion
[*] --> draft : promoter makes a package (51)
draft --> offered : promoter offers (55)
offered -[dotted]-> offered : promoter cannot offer it again (56)
[*] -[dotted]-> draft : sponsor cannot make a package (57)
offered --> agreed : sponsor buys it, alone or in a campaign (92, 93)
agreed -[dotted]-> agreed : sponsor cannot buy a sold package (95)
agreed --> [*]
@enduml
